  lines:
  - "Anh c\xF3 th\u1EA5y ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\u1EE9 "
  - "Nh\u1EEFng c\u1ED5 m\xE1y kia ch\xEDnh l\xE0 v\u0169 kh\xED m\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a
    Zenisth "
  - "Ch\xFAng r\u1EA5t nh\u1EA1y c\u1EA3m ngay c\u1EA3 v\u1EDBi \xE2m thanh "
  - "Khi anh di chuy\u1EC3n v\xE0 d\xF9ng s\xFAng s\u1EBD t\u1EA1o ra ti\u1EBFng
    \u0111\u1ED9ng thu h\xFAt ch\xFAng "
  - "H\xE3y c\xFAi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi xu\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1EC3 di chuy\u1EC3n th\u1EADt
    im l\u1EB7ng "
